#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ConfigValues.pm:388
msgid ""
"<p>After the Reduced Scoring Date all additional work done by the student "
"counts at a reduced rate. Here is where you set the reduced rate which must "
"be a percentage. For example if this value is 50% and a student views a "
"problem during the Reduced Scoring Period, they will see the message \"You "
"are in the Reduced Scoring Period: All additional work done counts 50% of "
"the original.\" </p><p>To use this, you also have to enable Reduced Scoring "
"and set the Reduced Scoring Date for individual assignments by editing the "
"set data using the Sets Manager.</p><p>This works with the "
"avg_problem_grader (which is the default grader) and the std_problem_grader "
"(the all or nothing grader). It will work with custom graders if they are "
"written appropriately.</p>"
msgstr "<p>在降低计分日期之后，学生所做的所有额外工作都按降低后的比率计算。在这里您可以设置这个降低后的比率，必须是一个百分比。例如，如果这个值是50%，学生在降低计分期间查看题目，他们会看到消息“您正处于降低计分期间：所有额外完成的工作按原分数的50%计算。”</p><p>要使用此功能，您还需要启用降低计分，并通过作业管理器编辑作业数据来设置各个作业的降低计分日期。</p><p>这适用于avg_problem_grader（默认评分器）和std_problem_grader（全有或全无评分器）。如果自定义评分器编写得当，也适用于它们。</p>"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ConfigValues.pm:750
msgid ""
"<p>During summer 2005, a newer version of the answer checkers was "
"implemented for answers which are functions and numbers. The newer checkers "
"allow more functions in student answers, and behave better in certain cases."
" Some problems are specifically coded to use new (or old) answer checkers. "
"However, for the bulk of the problems, you can choose what the default will "
"be here.</p><p>Choosing <i>false</i> here means that the newer answer "
"checkers will be used by default, and choosing <i>true</i> means that the "
"old answer checkers will be used by default.</p>"
msgstr "<p>在2005年夏天，针对函数和数字答案实现了新版本的答案检查器。新的检查器允许学生答案中使用更多函数，并且在某些情况下表现更好。有些题目专门编码使用新的（或旧的）答案检查器。但是，对于大多数题目，您可以在这里选择默认使用哪一个。</p><p>在这里选择<i>false</i>意味着默认使用新的答案检查器，选择<i>true</i>意味着默认使用旧的答案检查器。</p>"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ConfigValues.pm:721
msgid ""
"<p>MathQuill renders students answers in real-time as they type on the "
"keyboard.</p><p>MathView allows students to choose from a variety of common "
"math structures (such as fractions and square roots) as they attempt to "
"input their answers.</p>"
msgstr "<p>MathQuill在学生用键盘输入时实时渲染学生的答案。</p><p>MathView允许学生在尝试输入答案时从各种常见数学结构（如分数和平方根）中选择。</p>"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ConfigValues.pm:125
msgid ""
"<p>Mode in which the LANG and DIR settings for a single problem are "
"determined.</p><p>The system will set the LANGuage attribute to either a "
"value determined from the problem, a course-wide default, or the system "
"default, depending on the mode selected. The tag will only be added to the "
"DIV enclosing the problem if it is different than the value which should be "
"set in the main HTML tag set for the entire course based on the course "
"language.</p><p>There are two options for the DIRection attribute: \"ltr\" "
"for left-to-write scripts, and \"rtl\" for right-to-left scripts like Arabic"
" and Hebrew.</p><p>The DIRection attribute is needed to trigger proper "
"display of the question text when the problem text-direction is different "
"than that used by the current language of the course. For example, English "
"problems from the library browser would display improperly in RTL mode for a"
" Hebrew course, unless the problen Direction is set to LTR.</p><p>The "
"feature to set a problem language and direction was only added in 2018 to "
"the PG language, so most problems will not declare their language, and the "
"system needs to fall back to determining the language and direction in a "
"different manner. The OPL itself is all English, so the system wide fallback"
" is to en-US in LTR mode.</p><p>Since the defaults fall back to the LTR "
"direction, most sites should be fine with the \"auto::\" mode, but may want "
"to select the one which matches their course language. The mode "
"\"force::ltr\" would also be an option for a course which runs into trouble "
"with the \"auto\" modes.</p><p>Modes:</p><ul><li>\"none\" prevents any "
"additional LANG and/or DIR tag being added. The browser will use the main "
"setting which was applied to the entire HTML page. This is likely to cause "
"trouble when a problem of the other direction is "
"displayed.</li><li>\"auto::\" allows the system to make the settings based "
"on the language and direction reported by the problem (a new feature, so not"
" set in almost all existing problems) and falling back to the expected "
"default of en-US in LTR mode. </li><li>\"auto:LangCode:Dir\" allows the "
"system to make the settings based on the language and direction reported by "
"the problem (a new feature, so not set in almost all existing problems) but "
"falling back to the language with the given LangCode and the direction Dir "
"when problem settings are not available from PG.</li><li>\"auto::Dir\" for "
"problems without PG settings, this will use the default en=english language,"
" but force the direction to Dir. Problems with PG settings will get those "
"settings.</li><li>\"auto:LangCode:\" for problems without PG settings, this "
"will use the default LTR direction, but will set the language to "
"LangCode.Problems with PG settings will get those "
"settings.</li><li>\"force:LangCode:Dir\" will <b>ignore</b> any setting made"
" by the PG code of the problem, and will force the system to set the "
"language with the given LangCode and the direction to Dir for <b>all</b> "
"problems.</li><li>\"force::Dir\" will <b>ignore</b> any setting made by the "
"PG code of the problem, and will force the system to set the direction to "
"Dir for <b>all</b> problems, but will avoid setting any language attribute "
"for individual problem.</li></ul>"
msgstr "<p>确定单个题目的LANG和DIR设置的模式。</p><p>系统会根据所选模式，将LANGuage属性设置为由题目确定的值、整个课程的默认值或系统默认值。只有当该值与基于课程语言应设置在整个课程主HTML标签集中的值不同时，才会将该标签添加到包裹该题目的DIV中。</p><p>DIRection属性有两个选项：从左到右书写的文字用“ltr”，从右到左书写的文字（如阿拉伯语和希伯来语）用“rtl”。</p><p>当题目文本方向与课程当前语言使用的方向不同时，需要DIRection属性来触发问题文本的正确显示。例如，除非将问题的方向设置为LTR，否则来自题库浏览器的英语题目在希伯来语课程的RTL模式下会显示不正确。</p><p>设置题目语言和方向的功能是2018年才添加到PG语言中的，因此大多数题目不会声明其语言，系统需要退回到以其他方式确定语言和方向。OPL本身全部是英语，因此系统范围的回退是LTR模式下的en-US。</p><p>由于默认值回退到LTR方向，大多数网站使用“auto::”模式应该没问题，但可能想选择与其课程语言匹配的模式。对于遇到“auto”模式问题的课程，“force::ltr”模式也是一个选项。</p><p>模式：</p><ul><li>“none”阻止添加任何额外的LANG和/或DIR标签。浏览器将使用应用于整个HTML页面的主设置。当显示相反方向的题目时，这可能会造成问题。</li><li>“auto::”允许系统根据题目报告的语言和方向进行设置（这是一个新功能，因此几乎所有现有题目都未设置），并回退到LTR模式下预期的默认值en-US。</li><li>“auto:LangCode:Dir”允许系统根据题目报告的语言和方向进行设置（这是一个新功能，因此几乎所有现有题目都未设置），但在PG无法提供题目设置时回退到给定LangCode的语言和Dir方向。</li><li>“auto::Dir”对于没有PG设置的题目，将使用默认的en=英语语言，但强制方向为Dir。有PG设置的题目将获得那些设置。</li><li>“auto:LangCode:”对于没有PG设置的题目，将使用默认的LTR方向，但会将语言设置为LangCode。有PG设置的题目将获得那些设置。</li><li>“force:LangCode:Dir”将<b>忽略</b>题目PG代码所做的任何设置，并强制系统为<b>所有</b>题目设置给定LangCode的语言和Dir方向。</li><li>“force::Dir”将<b>忽略</b>题目PG代码所做的任何设置，并强制系统为<b>所有</b>题目设置Dir方向，但会避免为单个题目设置任何语言属性。</li></ul>"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ConfigValues.pm:182
msgid ""
"<p>Some servers handle courses taking place in different timezones. If this "
"course is not showing the correct timezone, enter the correct value here. "
"The format consists of unix times, such as \"America/New_York\", "
"\"America/Chicago\", \"America/Denver\", \"America/Phoenix\" or "
"\"America/Los_Angeles\".</p>Complete list: <a "
"href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_zoneinfo_time_zones\">TimeZoneFiles</a>"
msgstr "<p>有些服务器处理在不同时区进行的课程。如果这门课程没有显示正确的时区，请在这里输入正确的值。格式由unix时间组成，例如“America/New_York”、“America/Chicago”、“America/Denver”、“America/Phoenix”或“America/Los_Angeles”。</p>完整列表：<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_zoneinfo_time_zones\">TimeZoneFiles</a>"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ConfigValues.pm:1024
msgid ""
"<p>This can be set to one of the dates associated with assignments, or "
"\"Never\". For each assignment, if this setting is \"After the ... \" then "
"if it is after the indicated date, WeBWorK will send scores. If this setting"
" is \"Never\" then there is no date that will force WeBWorK to send scores "
"and only the $LTISendGradesEarlyThreshold can cause scores to be sent. If "
"scores are sent:</p> <ul><li>For 'course' grade passback mode, the "
"assignment will be included in the overall course score "
"calculation.</li><li>For 'homework' grade passback mode, the assignment's "
"score itself will be sent.</li></ul><p>If $LTISendScoresAfterDate is set to "
"\"After the reduced scoring date\" and an assignment has no reduced scoring "
"date or reduced scoring is disabled, the fallback is to use the close "
"date.</p><p>For a given assignment, WeBWorK will still send a score to the "
"LMS if the $LTISendGradesEarlyThreshold has been met, regardless of how "
"$LTISendScoresAfterDate is set.</p>"
msgstr "<p>这可以设置为与作业相关的日期之一，或“从不”。对于每个作业，如果此设置为“……之后”，那么如果超过指定日期，WeBWorK将发送分数。如果此设置为“从不”，则没有日期会强制WeBWorK发送分数，只有$LTISendGradesEarlyThreshold才能使分数被发送。如果分数被发送：</p> <ul><li>对于“course”成绩回传模式，该作业将被计入整体课程分数计算。</li><li>对于“homework”成绩回传模式，将发送该作业本身的分数。</li></ul><p>如果$LTISendScoresAfterDate设置为“降低计分日期之后”，且某个作业没有降低计分日期或已禁用降低计分，则回退为使用截止日期。</p><p>对于给定的作业，只要满足$LTISendGradesEarlyThreshold，WeBWorK仍会向LMS发送分数，无论$LTISendScoresAfterDate如何设置。</p>"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ConfigValues.pm:1050
msgid ""
"<p>This can either be set to a score or set to Attempted. When something "
"triggers a potential grade passback, if it is earlier than "
"$LTISendScoresAfterDate, the condition described by this variable must be "
"met or else no score will be sent.</p><p>If this variable is a score, then "
"the set will need to have a score that reaches or exceeds this score for its"
" score to be sent to the LMS (or included in the 'course' score "
"calculation). If this variable is set to Attempted, then the set needs to "
"have been attempted for its score to be sent to the LMS (or included in the "
"'course' score calculation).</p><p>For a regular or jitar set, 'attempted' "
"means that at least one exercise was attempted. For a test, 'attempted' "
"means that either multiple versions exist or there is one version with a "
"graded submission.</p>"
msgstr "<p>这可以设置为一个分数，或设置为“已尝试”。当某些事件触发潜在的成绩回传时，如果早于$LTISendScoresAfterDate，则必须满足此变量描述的条件，否则不会发送分数。</p><p>如果此变量是一个分数，则该作业需要达到或超过此分数，其分数才会被发送到LMS（或计入“course”分数计算）。如果此变量设置为“已尝试”，则该作业需要已被尝试过，其分数才会被发送到LMS（或计入“course”分数计算）。</p><p>对于常规或jitar作业，“已尝试”意味着至少尝试了一道练习题。对于测验，“已尝试”意味着存在多个版本，或者有一个已评分提交的版本。</p>"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ConfigValues.pm:374
msgid ""
"<p>This sets whether the Reduced Scoring system will be enabled. If enabled "
"you will need to set the default length of the reduced scoring period and "
"the value of work done in the reduced scoring period below.</p><p>To use "
"this, you also have to enable Reduced Scoring for individual assignments and"
" set their Reduced Scoring Dates by editing the set data.</p><p>This works "
"with the avg_problem_grader (which is the default grader) and the "
"std_problem_grader (the all or nothing grader). It will work with custom "
"graders if they are written appropriately.</p>"
msgstr "<p>这设置了是否启用降低计分系统。如果启用，您需要在下面设置降低计分期的默认长度以及降低计分期内所做工作的价值。</p><p>要使用此功能，您还需要为各个作业启用降低计分，并通过编辑作业数据来设置它们的降低计分日期。</p><p>这适用于avg_problem_grader（默认评分器）和std_problem_grader（全有或全无评分器）。如果自定义评分器编写得当，也适用于它们。</p>"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ConfigValues.pm:874
msgid ""
"<p>When students click the <em>Email Instructor</em> button to send "
"feedback, WeBWorK fills in the subject line. Here you can set the subject "
"line. In it, you can have various bits of information filled in with the "
"following escape sequences.</p><ul><li>%c = course ID</li><li>%u = user "
"ID</li><li>%s = set ID</li><li>%p = problem ID</li><li>%x = "
"section</li><li>%r = recitation</li><li>%% = literal percent "
"sign</li></ul><p>If content is between a brace pair, like '{ rec:%r}', then "
"it will only be included in the subject line if all substitutions within the"
" double brace pair are defined and nonempty."
msgstr "<p>当学生点击<em>发邮件给老师</em>按钮发送反馈时，WeBWorK会填写主题行。在这里您可以设置主题行。您可以使用以下转义序列在其中填入各种信息。</p><ul><li>%c = 课程ID</li><li>%u = 用户ID</li><li>%s = 作业ID</li><li>%p = 题目ID</li><li>%x = 班级</li><li>%r = 习题课</li><li>%% = 百分号本身</li></ul><p>如果内容在一对花括号之间，如“{ rec:%r}”，则只有当双花括号内的所有替换项都已定义且非空时，才会包含在主题行中。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ConfigValues.pm:990
msgid ""
"<p>When this is true, any time WeBWorK is about to send a score to the LMS, "
"it will first request from the LMS what that score currently is. Then if "
"there is no significant difference between the LMS score and the WeBWorK "
"score, WeBWorK will not follow through with updating the LMS score. This is "
"to avoid frequent insignificant updates to a student score in the LMS. With "
"some LMSs, students may receive notifications each time a score is updated, "
"and setting this variable will prevent too many notifications for them. This"
" does create a two-step process, first querying the current score from the "
"LMS and then actually updating the score (if there is a significant "
"difference). Additional details:</p><ul><li>If the LMS score is not 100%, "
"but the WeBWorK score is, then even if the LMS score is only insignificantly"
" less than 100%, it will be updated anyway.</li><li>If the LMS score is not "
"set and the WeBWorK score is 0, this is considered a significant difference "
"and the LMS score will updated to 0. However, the constraints of the "
"$LTISendScoresAfterDate and the $LTISendGradesEarlyThreshold variables "
"(described below) might apply, and the score may still not be updated in "
"this case.</li><li>\"Significant\" means an absolute difference of 0.001, or"
" 0.1%. At this time this is not configurable.</li></ul>"
msgstr "<p>如果此项为真，每当WeBWorK即将向LMS发送分数时，它会先向LMS请求当前分数是多少。然后，如果LMS分数与WeBWorK分数之间没有显著差异，WeBWorK将不会继续更新LMS分数。这是为了避免频繁地对LMS中的学生分数进行无关紧要的更新。在某些LMS中，每次分数更新时学生可能会收到通知，设置此变量将防止他们收到过多通知。这确实会产生一个两步过程，先从LMS查询当前分数，然后再实际更新分数（如果有显著差异）。其他细节：</p><ul><li>如果LMS分数不是100%，但WeBWorK分数是100%，那么即使LMS分数只是略低于100%，它仍会被更新。</li><li>如果LMS分数未设置且WeBWorK分数为0，这被视为显著差异，LMS分数将更新为0。但是，$LTISendScoresAfterDate和$LTISendGradesEarlyThreshold变量（下面描述）的约束可能适用，在这种情况下分数可能仍不会被更新。</li><li>“显著”意味着绝对差异为0.001，即0.1%。目前这不可配置。</li></ul>"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ConfigValues.pm:696
msgid ""
"<p>When viewing a problem, users may choose different methods of rendering "
"formulas via an options box in the left panel. Here, you can adjust what "
"display modes are listed.</p><p>The display modes are</p><ul><li>plainText: "
"shows the raw LaTeX strings for formulas.</li><li>images: produces images "
"using the external programs LaTeX and dvipng.</li><li>MathJax: uses "
"javascript to render mathematics.</li></ul><p>You must use at least one "
"display mode. If you select only one, then the options box will not give a "
"choice of modes (since there will only be one active).</p>"
msgstr "<p>查看题目时，用户可以通过左侧面板的选项框选择不同的公式渲染方法。在这里，您可以调整列出哪些显示模式。</p><p>显示模式有</p><ul><li>plainText：显示公式的原始LaTeX字符串。</li><li>images：使用外部程序LaTeX和dvipng生成图像。</li><li>MathJax：使用javascript渲染数学公式。</li></ul><p>您必须至少使用一种显示模式。如果您只选择一种，选项框将不会给出模式选择（因为只有一种是激活的）。</p>"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/GatewayQuiz.html.ep:399
msgid ""
"<strong>Warning</strong>: There may be something wrong with a problem in "
"this test. Please inform your instructor including the warning messages "
"below the problem."
msgstr "<strong>警告</strong>：这次测验中的某道题目可能有问题。请将题目下方的警告信息告知您的老师。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/Problem.html.ep:73
msgid ""
"<strong>Warning</strong>: There may be something wrong with this question. "
"Please inform your instructor including the warning messages below."
msgstr "<strong>警告</strong>：这道题目可能有问题。请将下方的警告信息告知您的老师。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ContentGenerator.pm:1230
msgid ""
"<strong>Warning</strong>: WeBWorK has encountered warnings while processing "
"your request. See the warning messages below for details."
msgstr "<strong>警告</strong>：WeBWorK在处理您的请求时遇到了警告。详情请见下方的警告信息。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/Instructor/Index.html.ep:228
msgid ""
"<strong>one</strong> set's details for <strong>some or all</strong> users"
msgstr "<strong>某些或全部</strong>用户的<strong>一次</strong>作业的详情"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/Instructor/Index.html.ep:303
msgid "<strong>selected</strong> sets"
msgstr "<strong>已选中</strong>的作业"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/Instructor/Index.html.ep:166
msgid "<strong>selected</strong> users"
msgstr "<strong>已选中</strong>的用户"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/Instructor/Index.html.ep:203
msgid "<strong>selected</strong> users to <strong>selected</strong> sets"
msgstr "<strong>已选中</strong>的用户到<strong>已选中</strong>的作业"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ConfigValues.pm:468
msgid ""
"<ul><li><b>SMAcheckAnswers</b>: Enables the \"Check Answers\" button <i>for "
"the new problem</i> when the \"Show Me Another\" button is "
"clicked.</li><li><b>SMAshowSolutions</b>: Shows the solution <i>for the new "
"problem</i> when the \"Show Me Another\" button is clicked (assuming that a "
"solution exists).</li><li><b>SMAshowCorrect</b>: Correct answers <i>for the "
"new problem</i> can be viewed when the \"Show Me Another\" button is "
"clicked. Note that SMACheckAnswers must also be enabled or the student will "
"have no way to view correct answers.</li><li><b>SMAshowHints</b>: Show hints"
" <i>for the new problem</i> (assuming hints exist).</li></ul>Note: There is "
"very little point enabling the Show Me Another feature unless you check at "
"least one of these options. Otherwise the students would simply see a new "
"version that cannot be attempted or learned from."
msgstr "<ul><li><b>SMAcheckAnswers</b>：点击“换一题”按钮时，为<i>新题目</i>启用“检查答案”按钮。</li><li><b>SMAshowSolutions</b>：点击“换一题”按钮时，显示<i>新题目</i>的解答（假设存在解答）。</li><li><b>SMAshowCorrect</b>：点击“换一题”按钮时，可以查看<i>新题目</i>的正确答案。请注意，还必须启用SMACheckAnswers，否则学生将无法查看正确答案。</li><li><b>SMAshowHints</b>：显示<i>新题目</i>的提示（假设存在提示）。</li></ul>注意：除非您至少勾选这些选项中的一个，否则启用“换一题”功能几乎没有意义。否则学生只会看到一个无法尝试或从中学习的新版本。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ConfigValues.pm:860
msgid ""
"A \"Reveal\" button must be clicked to make a correct answer visible any "
"time that correct answers for a problem are shown. Note that this is always "
"the case for instructors before answers are available to students (except "
"when the problem grader is open), and in \"Show Me Another\" problems."
msgstr "每当显示题目的正确答案时，都必须点击“显示”按钮才能使正确答案可见。请注意，在答案对学生可用之前（除非题目评分器打开），以及在“换一题”的题目中，对老师来说始终是这样的。"

