"that homework set. Uncheck the box to unassign a student. If a student is "
"unassigned from a homework set, all of the student's data for that homework "
"set is deleted and cannot be recovered. Use this action cautiously!"
msgstr "学生必须被分配作业才能在其WeBWorK主页上显示。勾选左列中的方框以将学生分配到该作业。取消勾选方框以取消该学生的分配。如果学生被从某次作业中取消分配，该学生在该作业上的所有数据将被删除且无法恢复。请谨慎使用此操作！"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorUsersAssignedToSet.html.ep:5
msgid ""
"A student needs to be assigned a set in order for them to work it. Once a "
"student is unassigned a set, all the data for them is lost and there is no "
"way to undo it. When unassigning be sure to change the option to \"Allow "
"unassign\"."
msgstr "学生需要被分配作业才能完成它。一旦学生被取消分配某次作业，其所有数据都将丢失，且无法撤销。取消分配时，请务必将选项更改为“允许取消分配”。"

# Leave symbol codes in place
#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ConfigValues.pm:234
msgid ""
"A switch to govern the use of a Progress Bar for the student; this also "
"enables/disables the highlighting of the current problem in the side bar, "
"and whether it is correct (&#x2713;), in progress (&hellip;), incorrect "
"(&#x2717;), or unattempted (no symbol)."
msgstr "一个用于控制学生进度条使用的开关；这也启用/禁用侧边栏中当前题目的高亮显示，以及是否正确（&#x2713;）、进行中（&hellip;）、错误（&#x2717;）或未尝试（无符号）。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ContentGenerator/Instructor/ProblemSetDetail.pm:371
msgid ""
"A test is broken up into pages with this many problems on each page.  "
"Students can move from page to page without clicking to grade the test, and "
"their temporary answers will be saved.  Use \"0\" to indicate \"all problems"
" on one page\".  For tests with many problems, either extreme (1 per page or"
" \"all on one page\") has drawbacks.  With 1 per page, the student has many "
"pages and may be frustrated trying to go back and find a particular problem."
"  With \"all on one page\", the student may spend a lot of time on that one "
"page without clicking anything that lets WeBWorK know they are still active,"
" and their session might expire for inactivity before they get around to "
"clicking the grade button. This situation can lead to their typed answers "
"being lost and unrecoverable.  Additionally, having many problems load at "
"the same time on one page can put a strain on the server.  This is "
"especially worth considering if the test has many dynamically generated "
"images, which can slow things down significantly."
msgstr "测验被分成若干页，每页有这么多题目。学生可以在页面之间移动而无需点击评分测验，他们的临时答案会被保存。使用“0”表示“所有题目在一页上”。对于题目很多的测验，两个极端（每页1题或“全部在一页上”）都有缺点。每页1题时，学生页数很多，可能会因为要返回查找特定题目而感到沮丧。“全部在一页上”时，学生可能会在那一页上花费大量时间而没有点击任何能让WeBWorK知道他们仍在活动的内容，他们的会话可能会因不活动而过期，然后才点击评分按钮。这种情况可能导致他们输入的答案丢失且无法恢复。此外，在一页上同时加载许多题目可能会给服务器带来压力。如果测验有许多动态生成的图像，这一点尤其值得考虑，因为这会显著减慢速度。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ContentGenerator/Instructor/ProblemSetDetail.pm:319
msgid ""
"A test may be configured to allow students one or more versions.  For each "
"version, this is the number of times you will allow them to click to have "
"that version graded.  Depending on other settings, they may or may not be "
"able to see scores and feedback following each grading. Use \"0\" to "
"indicate there is no cap on the number of graded submissions."
msgstr "测验可以配置为允许学生使用一个或多个版本。对于每个版本，这是您允许他们点击评分该版本的次数。根据其他设置，他们在每次评分后可能会或可能不会看到分数和反馈。使用“0”表示对评分提交次数没有上限。"

