#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/Instructor/SetMaker/problem_row.html.ep:68
msgid ""
"The Attempts figure is the global average of the number of attempts (both "
"correct and incorrect) individuals take on this problem.  A high figure may "
"represent a difficult problem.  Note that problems with multiple parts may "
"have higher average attempts since many students  will submit an answer to "
"each part before continuing and each such  submittal counts as an attempt."
msgstr "尝试次数是个人在此题目上的尝试次数（包括正确和错误）的全局平均值。较高的数值可能代表这是一道困难的题目。请注意，包含多个部分的题目可能具有较高的平均尝试次数，因为许多学生会在继续之前为每个部分提交答案，而每次此类提交都计为一次尝试。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/Instructor/SetMaker/problem_row.html.ep:160
msgid ""
"The Attempts figure is the local average of the number of attempts (both "
"correct and incorrect) individuals at your institution take on this problem."
" A high figure may represent a difficult problem.  Note that problems with "
"multiple parts may have higher average attempts since many students  will "
"submit an answer to each part before continuing and each such  submittal "
"counts as an attempt."
msgstr "尝试次数是您所在机构的个人在此题目上的尝试次数（包括正确和错误）的本地平均值。较高的数值可能代表这是一道困难的题目。请注意，包含多个部分的题目可能具有较高的平均尝试次数，因为许多学生会在继续之前为每个部分提交答案，而每次此类提交都计为一次尝试。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ContentGenerator/Instructor/UserList.pm:555
msgid "The LTI names/roles service URL is not available."
msgstr "LTI姓名/角色服务URL不可用。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ConfigValues.pm:459
msgid ""
"The Maximum number of times Show me Another can be used per problem by a "
"student. If set to -1 then there is no limit to the number of times that "
"Show Me Another can be used."
msgstr "每道题目每名学生可使用“换一题”的最大次数。如果设置为-1，则“换一题”的使用次数没有限制。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ConfigValues.pm:426
msgid ""
"The Reduced Scoring Period is the default period before the due date during "
"which all additional work done by the student counts at a reduced rate. When"
" enabling reduced scoring for a set the reduced scoring date will be set to "
"the due date minus this number. The reduced scoring date can then be "
"changed. If the Reduced Scoring is enabled and if it is after the reduced "
"scoring date, but before the due date, a message like \"This assignment has "
"a Reduced Scoring Period that begins 11/08/2009 at 06:17pm EST and ends on "
"the due date, 11/10/2009 at 06:17pm EST. During this period all additional "
"work done counts 50% of the original.\" will be displayed."
msgstr "降低计分期是截止日期之前的默认时段，在此期间，学生完成的所有额外工作都按降低的比率计算。为一次作业启用降低计分时，降低计分日期将设置为截止日期减去此数值。之后可以更改降低计分日期。如果启用了降低计分，且当前时间在降低计分日期之后但在截止日期之前，将显示类似“此作业有一个降低计分期，该时期于2009年11月8日美国东部时间下午6:17开始，并于截止日期2009年11月10日美国东部时间下午6:17结束。在此期间完成的所有额外工作按原分值的50%计算。”的消息。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/Instructor/SetMaker/problem_row.html.ep:89
msgid ""
"The Status figure is the global average of the Status individuals have "
"earned on this problem. The Status is the percentage correct (from 0% to "
"100%) recorded for the problem.  A low figure may  represent a difficult "
"problem.  The Status is often fairly high since  many students will work on "
"a problem until they get it correct or nearly so."
msgstr "状态数值是个人在此题目上获得的状态的全局平均值。状态是该题目记录的正确百分比（从0%到100%）。较低的数值可能代表这是一道困难的题目。状态通常相当高，因为许多学生会一直做某道题目，直到做对或接近做对为止。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/Instructor/SetMaker/problem_row.html.ep:181
