#. ('href="https://wiki.openwebwork.org/wiki/Set_Definition_Files"
#. target="Webworkdocs"')
#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorFileManager.html.ep:34
msgid ""
"These are stored in the templates directory. The format of <strong>Set "
"Definition files</strong> is described in the <a %1>Set Definition "
"specification</a>. Set definition files are mainly useful for transferring "
"set assignments from one course to another and are created when exporting a "
"problem set from the \"Sets Manager\". Each set definition file contains a "
"list of problems used and the dates and times. These definitions can be "
"imported into the current course."
msgstr "这些文件存储在模板目录中。<strong>作业定义文件</strong>的格式在<a %1>作业定义规范</a>中有描述。作业定义文件主要用于将作业从一个课程转移到另一个课程，在从“作业管理器”导出作业时创建。每个作业定义文件都包含所用题目的列表以及日期和时间。这些定义可以导入到当前课程中。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorFileManager.html.ep:69
msgid ""
"These are the files from which problems are generated and are located in the"
" templates directory or in subdirectories. They can be edited directly using"
" the \"Edit\" link on each problem page or from the \"Sets Manager\". The "
"File Manager allows you to upload or download these files. \tDirectories "
"that start with \"set\" contain pg files and are generated when exporting a "
"problem set in which there are local versions of a problem."
msgstr "这些是生成题目的文件，位于模板目录或其子目录中。可以使用每个题目页面上的“编辑”链接或从“作业管理器”直接编辑这些文件。文件管理器允许您上传或下载这些文件。\t以“set”开头的目录包含pg文件，是在导出含有题目本地版本的作业时生成的。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/Options.html.ep:33
msgid ""
"These options will only be shown if the user has the permission to change "
"display settings used in pg problems."
msgstr "只有当用户有权限更改pg题目中使用的显示设置时，才会显示这些选项。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/Levels.html.ep:29
msgid ""
"These problems require some application of algorithms, but do not rise to "
"the level of a full word problem. For example, \"Identify the local extrema "
"for f(x) = ...\". One has to apply algorithms and interpret results."
msgstr "这些题目需要一些算法的应用，但还未达到完整应用题的水平。例如，“求f(x) = ...的局部极值”。需要应用算法并解释结果。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/SampleProblemViewer/sample_problem.html.ep:36
msgid "These standard macros need to be loaded."
msgstr "需要加载这些标准宏。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ConfigValues.pm:605
msgid ""
"These users and higher get the \"Show Past Answers\" button on the problem "
"page."
msgstr "这些用户及更高权限的用户会在题目页面上获得“显示以往的答案”按钮。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/Instructor/UsersAssignedToSet.html.ep:18
msgid "This action can take a long time if there are many students."
msgstr "如果学生人数众多，此操作可能需要很长时间。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/Instructor/AchievementUserEditor.html.ep:10
msgid "This action will not overwrite existing users."
msgstr "此操作不会覆盖现有用户。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorFileManager.html.ep:5
msgid ""
"This allows for the viewing, downloading, uploading and other management of "
"files in the course. Select a file or set of files (using CTRL or SHIFT) and"
" click the desired button on the right. Many actions can only be done with a"
" single file (like view). Selecting a directory or set of files and clicking"
" \"Make Archive\" allows the creation of a compressed tar or zip file."
msgstr "这允许查看、下载、上传和以其他方式管理课程中的文件。选择一个文件或一组文件（使用Ctrl或Shift），然后点击右侧所需的按钮。许多操作只能对单个文件执行（如查看）。选择一个目录或一组文件并点击“创建归档”，可以创建压缩的tar或zip文件。"

#. ($c->formatDateTime($set->reduced_scoring_date,
#. $c->ce->{studentDateDisplayFormat})
#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/AchievementItems/ResurrectGW.pm:119
#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/AchievementItems/ResurrectHW.pm:106
msgid ""
"This assignment has been reopened and is due on %1.  After that date any "
"work completed will count for %2% of its value until %3."
msgstr "此作业已重新开放，截止日期为%1。在该日期之后完成的任何工作将按其价值的%2%计算，直到%3。"

#. ($c->formatDateTime($set->due_date, $c->ce->{studentDateDisplayFormat})
#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/AchievementItems/ResurrectGW.pm:127
#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/AchievementItems/ResurrectHW.pm:114
msgid "This assignment has been reopened and will now close on %1."
msgstr "此作业已重新开放，现在将于%1关闭。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/Grades/problem_table.html.ep:7
msgid "This assignment has zero problems."
msgstr "此作业没有任何题目。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorSetMaker.html.ep:19
msgid ""
"This browses the Open Problem Library (OPL) in category "
"(Subject/Chapter/Section) form. Select the desired categories (all three do "
"not need to be selected) and click \"View Problems\". If the \"Include "
"Contrib\" box is selected then those problems in the Contrib section of the "
"OPL that have the categories defined are also included. Contrib problems are"
" problem that haven't been vetted as thoroughly as OPL problems. If you want"
" hints or solutions included while browsing select the appropriate box."
msgstr "以类别（学科/章/节）形式浏览开放题库（OPL）。选择所需的类别（不需要全部三项都选择），然后点击“查看题目”。如果选中“包含Contrib”框，则OPL的Contrib部分中定义了相应类别的题目也会被包含在内。Contrib题目是审核程度不如OPL题目严格的题目。如果您想在浏览时包含提示或解答，请选中相应的框。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorProblemSetDetail.html.ep:32
msgid ""
"This button is also present both at top and the bottom of the page. Discards"
" all changes, reloading the page by re-reading the database information for "
"this set."
msgstr "此按钮也出现在页面的顶部和底部。放弃所有更改，通过重新读取此作业的数据库信息来重新加载页面。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorProblemSetDetail.html.ep:24
msgid ""
"This button is present both at top and the bottom of the page. Any and all "
"changes made to any part of the set will be saved. When editing the set for "
"one or more students, you can choose to override the default value (defined "
"for the set in general) by providing a value. If a value is not provided "
"then the default value for the set will be used for the users currently "
"being edited."
msgstr "此按钮出现在页面的顶部和底部。对该作业任何部分所做的任何及所有更改都将被保存。为一名或多名学生编辑作业时，您可以通过提供一个值来选择覆盖默认值（该作业整体定义的值）。如果未提供值，则当前正在编辑的用户将使用该作业的默认值。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HTML/SingleProblemGrader/grader.html.ep:118
msgid ""
"This can computed from the answer sub scores above using the weights shown "
"if they are modified.  Alternatively, enter the point score you want saved "
"here (the above sub scores will be ignored)."
msgstr "如果上方的答案子分数被修改，可以使用显示的权重从中计算得出此值。或者，在此处输入您想要保存的分值（上方的子分数将被忽略）。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ConfigValues.pm:820
msgid ""
"This configures if the manual problem grader or single problem grader has "
"inputs to enter problem scores as a percent, a point value, or both. Note, "
"the problem score is always saved as a percent, so when using a point value,"
" the problem score will be rounded to the nearest whole percent."
msgstr "这配置了手动题目评分器或单题评分器是否有输入框以百分比、分值或两者的形式输入题目分数。请注意，题目分数始终以百分比形式保存，因此使用分值时，题目分数将四舍五入为最接近的整数百分比。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ContentGenerator/Instructor/UserList.pm:549
msgid "This course is not configured to import users from the LMS via LTI."
msgstr "此课程未配置为通过LTI从LMS导入用户。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/Mojolicious/WeBWorK/Tasks/LTISetDateSync.pm:37
#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ContentGenerator/Instructor/ProblemSetList.pm:718
msgid ""
"This course is not configured to synchronize set dates with the LMS via LTI."
msgstr "此课程未配置为通过LTI与LMS同步作业日期。"

#. (tag('b', $guestLoginText)
#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/Login.html.ep:103
msgid ""
"This course supports guest logins. Click %1 to log into this course as a "
"guest."
msgstr "此课程支持访客登录。点击%1以访客身份登录此课程。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/Logout.html.ep:19
msgid ""
"This course uses an external authentication system. Please return to its "
"sign in page to log in again."
msgstr "此课程使用外部认证系统。请返回其登录页面重新登录。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/Login.html.ep:37
msgid ""
"This course uses an external authentication system. You've authenticated "
"through that system, but aren't allowed to log in to this course."
msgstr "此课程使用外部认证系统。您已通过该系统认证，但不被允许登录此课程。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/ProblemSets/set_list_row.html.ep:57
msgid "This date overrides the assignment date."
msgstr "此日期会覆盖作业日期。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ContentGenerator/Instructor/ProblemSetDetail.pm:186
msgid ""
"This date should be on or after the open date, and earlier or equal to the "
"close date. Answers submitted between the reduced scoring date and the close"
" date are scaled down by a factor that you can set in the Course Config "
"page.  If reduced scoring is being used, note that students will consider "
"the reduced scoring date to be the \"due date\", since that is the date when"
" they can no longer earn 100% for problems."
msgstr "此日期应在开始日期当天或之后，且早于或等于截止日期。在降低计分日期和截止日期之间提交的答案将按您可以在课程配置页面设置的系数进行缩减。如果使用了降低计分，请注意学生会认为降低计分日期是“截止日期”，因为那是他们无法再为题目获得100%分数的日期。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/Options.html.ep:51
msgid ""
"This determines if MathQuill answer blanks are enable for the user. This "
"option is only present if MathQuill is enabled for the course."
msgstr "这决定了是否为该用户启用MathQuill答案空白。仅当课程启用了MathQuill时才会显示此选项。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/Options.html.ep:56
msgid ""
"This determines if the MathView equation editor button will be appended to "
"text answer blanks. his option is only present if MathView is enabled for "
"the course."
msgstr "这决定了MathView公式编辑器按钮是否会附加到文本答案空白处。仅当课程启用了MathView时才会显示此选项。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/Options.html.ep:45
msgid ""
"This determines whether or not saved past answers are automatically filled "
"in to the problem form when a student returns to a problem after having left"
" the problem. This option is only visible if the user has the permission to "
"show old answers."
msgstr "这决定了当学生离开某道题目后返回时，已保存的以往答案是否会自动填入题目表单。仅当用户有权限显示以往的答案时才可见此选项。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorFileManager.html.ep:77
msgid ""
"This directory is accessible from the web. You can use it to store html "
"documents or image documents that are used by the course. Do not store "
"private information in this directory or in any subdirectory thereof. These "
"documents can be linked to from within problems using the htmlLink macro."
msgstr "此目录可从网页访问。您可以使用它来存储课程使用的html文档或图像文档。请勿在此目录或其任何子目录中存储私人信息。可以使用htmlLink宏从题目内部链接到这些文档。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ConfigValues.pm:353
msgid ""
"This email address will be used as the sender for achievement notifications."
" Achievement notifications will not be sent unless this is set."
msgstr "此电子邮件地址将用作成就通知的发件人。除非设置了此项，否则不会发送成就通知。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ContentGenerator/TwoFactorAuthentication.pm:91
msgid ""
"This email should be deleted once you have completely signed in the first "
"time."
msgstr "一旦您首次完全登录，应删除此电子邮件。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/Problem/submit_buttons.html.ep:102
msgid ""
"This feature has been used the maximum allowed number of times for this "
"problem, and cannot be used again."
msgstr "此功能在此题目上已使用了允许的最大次数，无法再次使用。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorAchievementUserEditor.html.ep:5
msgid ""
"This form can assign, unassign, and edit user data for a single achievement."
"  You can assign the achievement to all current users or select which users "
"to assign the achievement to and click Save.  You can unassign the "
"achievement by unchecking a student's name (note all data will be deleted). "
"To unassign the achievement from all users, first select \"Allow unassign\" "
"and then click the \"Unassign from All Users\" button. You can also toggle "
"the earned status with the checkbox in the \"Earned\" column and edit the "
"achievement counter for counting achievements."
msgstr "此表单可以为单个成就分配、取消分配和编辑用户数据。您可以将成就分配给所有当前用户，或选择要分配成就的用户并点击保存。您可以通过取消勾选学生姓名来取消分配成就（注意，所有数据都将被删除）。要从所有用户中取消分配成就，请先选择“允许取消分配”，然后点击“从所有用户中取消分配”按钮。您还可以使用“已获得”列中的复选框切换获得状态，并编辑用于计数成就的成就计数器。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/Instructor/Stats/set_stats.html.ep:23
msgid ""
"This gives the status and dates of the main set. Individual students may "
"have different settings."
msgstr "这给出了主作业的状态和日期。单个学生可能有不同的设置。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/ProblemSet/problem_list.html.ep:59
msgid "This homework set contains no problems."
msgstr "这个作业没有包含任何题目。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ContentGenerator/Problem.pm:1056
msgid "This homework set is closed."
msgstr "这个作业已关闭。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ContentGenerator/Problem.pm:1054
msgid "This homework set is not yet open."
msgstr "这个作业还未开始。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ContentGenerator/Instructor/ProblemSetDetail.pm:563
msgid ""
"This is a number between 0 and 1 indicating the student's score for the "
"problem.  Change this to 1 to manually award full credit on this problem."
msgstr "这是一个介于0和1之间的数字，表示学生在该题目上的分数。将其更改为1可手动为此题目给予满分。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ContentGenerator/Instructor/ProblemSetDetail.pm:488
msgid ""
"This is a relative weight to be attached to the problem, either in the "
"context of scoring the set, or in the context of calculating a score for a "
"collection of sets."
msgstr "这是附加到该题目的相对权重，无论是在为该作业评分的背景下，还是在为一组作业计算分数的背景下。"

#. ($hours, $minutes)
#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/ProblemSet/version_list.html.ep:98
msgid ""
"This is a timed test. You will have %quant(%1,hour) and %quant(%2,minute) to"
" complete the test."
msgstr "这是一次计时测验。您将有%1小时%2分钟来完成测验。"

#. ($hours, $minutes)
#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/ProblemSet/version_list.html.ep:107
msgid ""
"This is a timed test. You will have "
"%quant(%1,hour,hours,)%quant(%2,minute,minutes,) to complete the test."
msgstr "这是一次计时测验。您将有%1小时%2分钟来完成测验。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorUserList.html.ep:74
msgid ""
"This is done by first entering the user as a student and then changing the "
"permission level of the user. First edit the user by clicking on the pencil "
"next to their name (or using the technique above for several users), then "
"change their permission level -- an entry blank at the far right of the "
"screen, you may have to scroll to see it. The permission levels are"
msgstr "这可以通过先将用户录入为学生，然后更改该用户的权限级别来完成。首先点击其姓名旁的铅笔编辑该用户（或对多名用户使用上述技巧），然后更改其权限级别——屏幕最右侧的一个输入空白处，您可能需要滚动才能看到它。权限级别为"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorUserList.html.ep:165
msgid ""
"This is done from the \"Sets Manager\" or from the \"Instructor Tools\" page"
" if you wish to assign a set to all students or a large group of students "
"(e.g. a section)."
msgstr "如果您希望将作业分配给所有学生或一大群学生（例如一个班级），这可以从“作业管理器”或“老师工具”页面完成。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorUserList.html.ep:170
msgid "This is done from the \"Sets Manager\" or from the \"Instructor Tools\" page."
msgstr "这可以从“作业管理器”或“老师工具”页面完成。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorUserList.html.ep:180
msgid "This is done from the \"Sets Manager\" page or the \"Instructor tools\" page."
msgstr "这可以从“作业管理器”页面或“老师工具”页面完成。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ContentGenerator/Instructor/ProblemSetDetail.pm:124
msgid ""
"This is generally the date when students can begin visiting the set and "
"submitting answers. Prior to this date, if the set is assigned to a user and"
" it is flagged \"visible\", they can see that it exists and when it will "
"open, but cannot view the problems. If using \"course\" grade passback to an"
" LMS, only those sets that are past their open date are factored in to the "
"overall course grade that is passed back.  Note that certain permissions can"
" be changed so that the details explained here are no longer true."
msgstr "这通常是学生可以开始访问该作业并提交答案的日期。在此日期之前，如果该作业已分配给某用户且被标记为“可见”，他们可以看到该作业存在以及何时开放，但无法查看题目。如果使用“课程”成绩回传到LMS，则只有已过开始日期的作业才会计入回传的整体课程成绩。请注意，可以更改某些权限，使此处说明的细节不再成立。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ContentGenerator/Instructor/ProblemSetDetail.pm:151
msgid ""
"This is generally the date when students can click a checkbox to see the "
"expected correct answers to problems in the set.  If a problem has a coded "
"solution, this is also when thy can click to see that solution.  Note that "
"certain permissions can be changed so that the details explained here are no"
" longer true.  This date must come on or after the close date."
msgstr "这通常是学生可以点击复选框查看该作业中题目预期正确答案的日期。如果某道题目有编写好的解答，这也是他们可以点击查看该解答的时间。请注意，可以更改某些权限，使此处说明的细节不再成立。此日期必须在截止日期当天或之后。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ContentGenerator/Instructor/ProblemSetDetail.pm:138
msgid ""
"This is generally the date when students can no longer use the \"Submit\" "
"button to submit an answer and have it assessed for credit.  However "
"students can still visit the set, type or select answers, and use the "
"\"Check Answers\" button to be assessed without credit.  Note that certain "
"permissions can be changed so that the details explained here are no longer "
"true. This date must come on or after the open date."
msgstr "这通常是学生不能再使用“提交”按钮提交答案以获得学分评估的日期。但是，学生仍然可以访问该作业、输入或选择答案，并使用“检查答案”按钮进行无学分评估。请注意，可以更改某些权限，使此处说明的细节不再成立。此日期必须在开始日期当天或之后。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorUserList.html.ep:64
msgid ""
"This is most easily done by importing a class list. The class list can be "
"uploaded from your workstation to the server using the File Manager page. "
"The class list must be a file ending in .lst and must have a specific <a "
"href=\"https://wiki.openwebwork.org/wiki/Classlist_Files#Format_of_classlist_files\">format</a>."
" Once the file has been uploaded to the server the file will appear in the "
"import action pop-up list (5th action). demoCourse.lst is available for most"
" courses and adds the \"practice users\" which activate guest logins to the "
"class list."
msgstr "最简单的做法是导入班级名单。可以使用文件管理页面将班级名单从您的工作站上传到服务器。班级名单必须是以.lst结尾的文件，且必须具有特定的<a href=\"https://wiki.openwebwork.org/wiki/Classlist_Files#Format_of_classlist_files\">格式</a>。文件上传到服务器后，将出现在导入操作弹出列表中（第5项操作）。大多数课程都提供demoCourse.lst，它会向班级名单添加激活访客登录的“练习用户”。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/Instructor/FileManager/refresh.html.ep:46
msgid "This is not a viewable file type."
msgstr "这不是可查看的文件类型。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/admin_links.html.ep:10
msgid ""
"This is the administration course which is used to manage courses on this "
"server.  Use the \"Admin Menu\" to select the desired action."
msgstr "这是用于管理此服务器上课程的管理课程。使用“管理菜单”选择所需的操作。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ConfigValues.pm:810
msgid ""
"This is the default number of attempts a student must make before hints will"
" be shown to the student. Set this to -1 to hide hints. Note that this can "
"be overridden with a per problem setting."
msgstr "这是学生在显示提示之前必须进行的默认尝试次数。将此设置为-1可隐藏提示。请注意，这可以通过按题目设置来覆盖。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ConfigValues.pm:450
msgid ""
"This is the default number of attempts before show me another becomes "
"available to students. It can be set to -1 to disable show me another by "
"default."
msgstr "这是“换一题”对学生可用之前的默认尝试次数。可以设置为-1以默认禁用“换一题”。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/Instructor/UserList/import_form.html.ep:42
msgid ""
"This is the field in the class list file that will be used for the password "
"if the password and unencrypted password fields are both empty. If it is set"
" to \"None\", and no password is provided either in the password field or "
"the unencrypted password field, or if no value is provided for the field "
"this is set to in the class list file, then the user will be created without"
" a password."
msgstr "如果密码字段和未加密密码字段均为空，这是班级名单文件中将用作密码的字段。如果设置为“无”，且密码字段或未加密密码字段中均未提供密码，或者班级名单文件中此项所设置的字段未提供值，则该用户将在没有密码的情况下被创建。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/Instructor/AddUsers.html.ep:50
msgid ""
"This is the field that will be used for the password if the password field "
"is left blank. If it is set to \"None\", and no password is provided in the "
"password field, or if no value is provided for the field this is set to, "
"then the user will be created without a password."
msgstr "如果密码字段留空，这是将用作密码的字段。如果设置为“无”，且密码字段中未提供密码，或者此项所设置的字段未提供值，则该用户将在没有密码的情况下被创建。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ConfigValues.pm:112
msgid ""
"This is the format of the dates displayed for students. This can be created "
"from <a href=\"https://metacpan.org/pod/DateTime#strftime-"
"Patterns\">strftime patterns</a>, e.g., <span class=\"text-nowrap\">\"%a %b "
"%d at %l:%M%P\"</span>, or can be one of the <a "
"href=\"https://metacpan.org/pod/DateTime::Locale::FromData\">localizable "
"formats</a> \"datetime_format_short\", \"datetime_format_medium\", "
"\"datetime_format_long\", or \"datetime_format_full\"."
msgstr "这是向学生显示日期的格式。可以根据<a href=\"https://metacpan.org/pod/DateTime#strftime-Patterns\">strftime模式</a>创建，例如<span class=\"text-nowrap\">“%a %b %d at %l:%M%P”</span>，也可以是<a href=\"https://metacpan.org/pod/DateTime::Locale::FromData\">可本地化格式</a>“datetime_format_short”“datetime_format_medium”“datetime_format_long”或“datetime_format_full”之一。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ConfigValues.pm:302
msgid ""
"This is the number of achievement points given to each user for completing a"
" problem if the problem is in a set that is in the reduced scoring period."
msgstr "如果该题目所在的作业处于降低计分期，这是每名用户完成该题目所获得的成就点数。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ConfigValues.pm:291
msgid ""
"This is the number of achievement points given to each user for completing a"
" problem. The default collection of achievements is designed for a course "
"where a student who completes all the exercises would earn 1000 points, not "
"counting points from badges. It is recommended that if you use the default "
"collection and your course has N problems, set this value to 1000/N."
msgstr "这是每名用户完成一道题目所获得的成就点数。默认成就集合的设计目标是，在一门课程中，完成所有练习的学生将获得1000点（不计徽章点数）。建议如果您使用默认集合，且您的课程有N道题目，请将此值设置为1000/N。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HTML/SingleProblemGrader/grader.html.ep:192
msgid ""
"This is the only part of the score that is actually saved. This is computed "
"from the answer sub scores above using the weights shown if they are "
"modified.  Alternatively, enter the score you want saved here (the above sub"
" scores will be ignored)."
msgstr "这是分数中实际保存的唯一部分。如果上方的答案子分数被修改，该值将使用显示的权重从中计算得出。或者，在此处输入您想要保存的分数（上方的子分数将被忽略）。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/SampleProblemViewer/sample_problem.html.ep:38
msgid "This is the problem statement in PGML."
msgstr "这是PGML中的题目陈述。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/ProblemSets.html.ep:4
msgid "This is the standard entry point for the course."
msgstr "这是该课程的标准入口点。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/SampleProblemViewer/sample_problem.html.ep:39
msgid "This is used for answer checking."
msgstr "这用于答案检查。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorFileManager.html.ep:84
msgid ""
"This is where email messages and templates are saved. You can upload or "
"download files in this directory if you wish to save the files for later."
msgstr "这是电子邮件消息和模板保存的地方。如果您想保存文件以备后用，可以在此目录中上传或下载文件。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorPGProblemEditor.html.ep:51
msgid ""
"This is where you edit the code of the problem. Type Ctrl-Enter while this "
"window has focus to re-render the problem. In addition, the following "
"keyboard shortcuts are available."
msgstr "这是您编辑题目代码的地方。在此窗口聚焦时按Ctrl-Enter可重新渲染该题目。此外，还提供以下键盘快捷键。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/GatewayQuiz.html.ep:769
msgid ""
"This is your last submission.  If you say yes, then your answers will be "
"final, and you will not be able to continue to work this test version."
msgstr "这是您的最后一次提交。如果您选择是，则您的答案将成为最终答案，您将无法继续完成此测验版本。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/GatewayQuiz.html.ep:773
msgid ""
"This is your only submission.  If you say yes, then your answers will be "
"final, and you will not be able to continue to work this test version."
msgstr "这是您唯一的一次提交。如果您选择是，则您的答案将成为最终答案，您将无法继续完成此测验版本。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/AchievementItems/ExtendReducedDate.pm:45
#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/AchievementItems/NoReducedCred.pm:37
#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/AchievementItems/ReducedCred.pm:39
msgid ""
"This item won't work unless your instructor enables the reduced scoring "
"feature.  Let your instructor know that you received this message."
msgstr "除非您的老师启用了降低计分功能，否则此道具不会生效。请告知您的老师您收到了此消息。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorPGProblemEditor.html.ep:26
msgid ""
"This link gives details for many macros. It links to documentation embedded "
"in the macro files themselves."
msgstr "此链接提供许多宏的详细信息。它链接到宏文件本身中嵌入的文档。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorPGProblemEditor.html.ep:38
msgid ""
"This links to a WeBWorK \"problem\" which allows you to try out fragments of"
" PGML code."
msgstr "此链接指向一个WeBWorK“题目”，让您可以尝试PGML代码片段。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorPGProblemEditor.html.ep:23
msgid "This links to a page describing Math Object usage."
msgstr "此链接指向一个描述数学对象用法的页面。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorPGProblemEditor.html.ep:46
msgid "This links to problem authoring information on the WeBWorK wiki."
msgstr "此链接指向WeBWorK wiki上的题目编写信息。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/Options.html.ep:39
msgid ""
"This may be Mathjax, images, or plainText. Only the options that are enabled"
" for the course will be available to select. This option is only visible if "
"there is more than one display mode enabled for the course."
msgstr "这可以是Mathjax、图像或纯文本。只有该课程启用的选项才可选择。仅当该课程启用了多种显示模式时，此选项才可见。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ConfigValues.pm:1227
msgid ""
"This must be set in order to utilize LTI content selection. The WeBWorK "
"content item URL must be set for the external tool in the LMS first. Then if"
" content selection from the LMS is attempted, you will be shown the LMS "
"context ID. Enter the context ID shown here, and then you will be able to "
"select assignments from this course, and import them into the LMS."
msgstr "必须设置此项才能使用LTI内容选择。必须先在LMS中为外部工具设置WeBWorK内容项URL。然后，如果尝试从LMS进行内容选择，将向您显示LMS上下文ID。在此处输入显示的上下文ID，然后您就可以从此课程中选择作业并将其导入LMS。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ContentGenerator/Instructor/ProblemSetDetail.pm:552
msgid ""
"This number is used to control how the random elements of the problem will "
"be generated. Change this number to rerandomize a student's version."
msgstr "此数字用于控制该题目随机元素的生成方式。更改此数字可重新随机化学生的版本。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/Instructor/PGProblemEditor/code_maintenance_form.html.ep:59
msgid ""
"This option analyzes the code with PG Critic which gives suggestions on "
"using modern PG constructs and ensures that the code conforms to current "
"best-practices."
msgstr "此选项使用PG Critic分析代码，提供使用现代PG结构的建议，并确保代码符合当前的最佳实践。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/Instructor/PGProblemEditor/code_maintenance_form.html.ep:36
msgid ""
"This option converts the text blocks in the problem code to PGML and updates"
" the loadMacros to include PGML and drop others. This can be used as a first"
" pass of the conversion, however the author will still need to ensure the "
"problem functions.  One area of attention should be the answer blanks, which"
" may not be converted correctly."
msgstr "此选项将题目代码中的文本块转换为PGML，并更新loadMacros以包含PGML并删除其他内容。这可以用作转换的第一遍，但作者仍需确保该题目功能正常。需要注意的一个方面是答案空白，它们可能没有被正确转换。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorSetMaker.html.ep:27
msgid "This option shows all pg problems in the course directory structure."
msgstr "此选项显示课程目录结构中的所有pg题目。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorSetMaker.html.ep:32
msgid ""
"This option shows all problems in set definition files that are located in "
"the course directory."
msgstr "此选项显示位于课程目录中的作业定义文件中的所有题目。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorSetMaker.html.ep:29
msgid ""
"This option shows all problems in sets that have been created in the course."
msgstr "此选项显示该课程中已创建作业中的所有题目。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorAchievementNotificationEditor.html.ep:5
msgid ""
"This page allows one to edit and set the achievement email notification "
"template for an achievement.  In addition to setting an email notification "
"template for an achievement here, you must also set the \"email address to "
"use when sending Achievement notifications\" in the optional modules of the "
"course configuration in order for email notifications to be sent."
msgstr "此页面允许您编辑和设置某个成就的成就电子邮件通知模板。除了在此处为成就设置电子邮件通知模板外，您还必须在课程配置的可选模块中设置“发送成就通知时使用的电子邮件地址”，才能发送电子邮件通知。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorPGProblemEditor.html.ep:5
msgid ""
"This page allows one to edit the contents of PG problem files as well as set"
" headers and other files."
msgstr "此页面允许您编辑PG题目文件以及作业头文件和其他文件的内容。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorJobManager.html.ep:5
msgid ""
"This page allows one to view and manage jobs in job queue. Note that "
"completed jobs are automatically removed from the job queue after two days. "
"So there is no real need to delete jobs. The importance of this page is to "
"see the status of recently completed or in progress jobs."
msgstr "此页面允许您查看和管理任务队列中的任务。请注意，已完成的任务会在两天后自动从任务队列中移除。因此实际上无需删除任务。此页面的重要之处在于查看最近完成或正在进行的任务的状态。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/Options.html.ep:5
msgid ""
"This page allows users to change their password, email address, and display "
"settings used in problems. Note that you can hide this page entirely for "
"students by setting permission levels to login_proctor or higher for the "
"permissions to change password, change email address, and change display "
"settings used in pg problems."
msgstr "此页面允许用户更改密码、电子邮件地址以及题目中使用的显示设置。请注意，您可以通过将更改密码、更改电子邮件地址和更改pg题目中使用的显示设置的权限级别设置为login_proctor或更高，来对学生完全隐藏此页面。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorConfig.html.ep:5
msgid ""
"This page allows you to configure course settings such as permission levels,"
" display modes allowed, default display mode, email feedback behavior, and "
"much more."
msgstr "此页面允许您配置课程设置，例如权限级别、允许的显示模式、默认显示模式、电子邮件反馈行为等等。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/Achievements.html.ep:5
msgid ""
"This page displays a student's current achievement level and progress toward"
" the next level, and lists the rewards and badges that the student has "
"earned. If rewards have been earned, then the student may also redeem those "
"rewards."
msgstr "此页面显示学生当前的成就等级以及向下一等级的进度，并列出该学生已获得的奖励和徽章。如果已获得奖励，学生也可以兑换这些奖励。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorUserList.html.ep:12
msgid ""
"This page gives access to information about the student, independent of the "
"assignments assigned to them."
msgstr "此页面提供关于该学生的信息，与分配给他们的作业无关。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorLTIUpdate.html.ep:5
msgid ""
"This page gives information about mass LTI grade updates and allows you to "
"trigger a grade update. "
msgstr "此页面提供关于批量LTI成绩更新的信息，并允许您触发成绩更新。 "

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorIndex.html.ep:5
msgid ""
"This page is a collection of tools to modify users and sets.  These tools "
"are shortcuts for common actions that allow selecting multiple users or sets"
" to act on at once.  Because multiple users and sets can be acted on at the "
"same time, it is often more efficient to use this page when modifying "
"multiple items.  For example, you can change the close date for several "
"users for an assignment. This page also gives access to \"Edit assignments "
"and dates for one user\", which can be used to access settings for all sets "
"including test versions for that user."
msgstr "此页面是一组用于修改用户和作业的工具集合。这些工具是常见操作的快捷方式，允许一次选择多个用户或作业进行操作。由于可以同时对多个用户和作业进行操作，因此在修改多个条目时使用此页面通常更高效。例如，您可以为一次作业更改多名用户的截止日期。此页面还提供访问“为一名用户编辑作业和日期”的入口，可用于访问该用户所有作业（包括测验版本）的设置。"

#. (q(table to save any changes.  Each student's name links to that student's
#. problem and opens up the)
#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorProblemGrader.html.ep:5
msgid ""
"This page is for manually grading a problem for all assigned students.  The "
"table of students shows their last answers, percent score, and feedback "
"comment.  The \"Save\" button is located below the "
msgstr "此页面用于为所有被分配的学生手动为一道题目评分。学生表格显示他们的最后一次答案、百分比分数和反馈备注。“保存”按钮位于下方 "

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorSetMaker.html.ep:5
msgid ""
"This page is used to browse problems that will be used to fill problem sets."
" The first step is to choose which set you are working on. If you need to "
"create a new problem set fill in the blank next to the \"Create a New Set in"
" This Course\" button and then press the button. Then choose which set you "
"want to work on in the drop down menu."
msgstr "此页面用于浏览将用于填充作业的题目。第一步是选择您正在使用的作业。如果您需要创建新作业，请在“在此课程中创建新作业”按钮旁的空白处填写，然后按下该按钮。然后在下拉菜单中选择您想要使用的作业。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorStudentProgress.html.ep:5
msgid ""
"This page is useful for monitoring student progress on assignments. Student "
"progress can either be viewed for a single set or for a single student."
msgstr "此页面对监控学生在作业上的进度很有用。学生进度可以按单次作业或单个学生查看。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorProblemSetList.html.ep:5
msgid ""
"This page manages all problem sets (including quizzes/tests). The following "
"allow editing directly of a single problem set."
msgstr "此页面管理所有作业（包括小测/测验）。以下内容允许直接编辑单个作业。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/Grades.html.ep:5
msgid ""
"This page shows the student's current grade for all assignments they are "
"assigned to.  This page only shows assignments and grades visible to the "
"student. To view all grades, visit the \"Student Progress\" page for the "
"student. The student navigation menu at the top can be used to change which "
"student's grades to view"
msgstr "此页面显示学生在其被分配的所有作业上的当前成绩。此页面仅显示对该学生可见的作业和成绩。要查看所有成绩，请访问该学生的“学生进度”页面。顶部的学生导航菜单可用于更改要查看哪名学生的成绩"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/SampleProblemViewer/sample_problem.html.ep:37
msgid "This perl code sets up the problem."
msgstr "此perl代码设置该题目。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ConfigValues.pm:540
msgid ""
